      {
        "id": 233463,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-08-12T04:43:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1) Pick the powers you want to repeat, it can be a single power multiple times, or the several different powers once (don't forget to pay for them!).</p>\n<p>2) It cover the ENTIRE Invader Phase, which includes Events, Fear cards (providing they have the \"Each Board/Land...\" wording) and Invader Actions.</p>\n<p>3) You are reading that right-&nbsp;sometimes it helps, sometimes it doesn't (like most events).</p>\n<p>4) Yes, it persists between turns. The balance is that with each unit&nbsp;of Time you are saving, you have one less Presence to put on the Island.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:09:17.970Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
