        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>1) Pick the powers you want to repeat, it can be a single power multiple times, or the several different powers once (don't forget to pay for them!).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2) It cover the ENTIRE Invader Phase, which includes Events, Fear cards (providing they have the \"Each Board/Land...\" wording) and Invader Actions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3) You are reading that right-&nbsp;sometimes it helps, sometimes it doesn't (like most events).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4) Yes, it persists between turns. The balance is that with each unit&nbsp;of Time you are saving, you have one less Presence to put on the Island.</p>",
